00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.3 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand personality, voice and tone

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your voice stays the same; your tone changes with the situation. Write both down early.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Choose three or four traits from your values.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Describe each trait as “this, not that”.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Never reduce people to their problems.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You define your personality, voice, tone and word list.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

